# OpenCode + Cursor bridge

This project uses OpenCode and Cursor together.

## Skills

- Project skills: `.opencode/skills/` (synced to `.cursor/skills/opencode/` via `scripts/sync-opencode-to-cursor.ps1`)
- Power-pack skills: synced to `.cursor/skills/opencode-power-pack/` when the sync script has been run
- Re-run the sync script after OpenCode plugin updates or on a new machine

## Agents

Custom subagents live in `.cursor/agents/` (exported from OpenCode power-pack):

- `code-explorer` — trace and explain existing features
- `code-architect` — design implementation blueprints
- `code-reviewer` — review changes for bugs, security, and conventions

## MCP

Atlassian/Jira MCP is configured in `.cursor/mcp.json` (mirrors `opencode.json`).

## OpenCode config

Root `opencode.json` is the single project config. Do not add a nested `.opencode/opencode.json`.
